   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "What a performance marketing consultant fixes",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-309\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-309\">What a performance marketing <span class=\"accent\">consultant fixes</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Pick a situation to see how we help.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt cmvt\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt__list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Consulting situations\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\"><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-308-t-strategy\" aria-controls=\"bh-308-strategy\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">01</i>No clear plan</b><span>Your team runs campaigns, but nobody has stepped back to ask which platforms, budgets and goals make sense.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--2\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-308-t-audit\" aria-controls=\"bh-308-audit\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">02</i>You’re not sure what’s working</b><span>Results are flat, and you can’t tell if it’s the ads, the tracking or the pages.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--3\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-308-t-team\" aria-controls=\"bh-308-team\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">03</i>Your team needs a sounding board</b><span>Your specialists are good, but there’s nobody senior to check their thinking.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--4\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-308-t-agency\" aria-controls=\"bh-308-agency\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">04</i>Your agency isn’t delivering</b><span>You pay an agency, but reports are vague and results are flat.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt__panels\"><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--1\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-308-strategy\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-308-t-strategy\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Your team runs campaigns, but nobody has stepped back to ask which platforms, budgets and goals make sense.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">A channel plan your team can run with.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In-house teams are busy running campaigns. A consultant gives you the time and outside view to plan properly.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Workshops with marketing, sales and finance</li><li>Targets based on your margins</li><li>A clear role for each platform</li><li>A roadmap your team owns</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A plan makes every weekly decision easier.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Channel plan</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Google Ads</span><b>Capture demand</b></li><li><span>Meta</span><b>Create demand</b></li><li><span>LinkedIn</span><b>Reach buyers</b></li><li><span>Budget split</span><b>50 / 30 / 20</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Goals and numbers</b><p>What a lead or sale is worth, and what you can afford to pay.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Channel plan</b><p>Which platforms do which job.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Budget model</b><p>How much to spend where, and when to scale.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>90-day roadmap</b><p>The order to do things in.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> A channel plan</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> A budget model</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> A 90-day roadmap</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--2\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-308-audit\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-308-t-audit\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Results are flat, and you can’t tell if it’s the ads, the tracking or the pages.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">An independent audit, with a ranked fix list.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>An outside view finds what people close to the account no longer see.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>All platforms reviewed</li><li>Tracking checked against your CRM</li><li>Waste sized in money</li><li>Fixes your team can make</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Most audits pay for themselves in the first month.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Audit summary</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Wasted spend</span><b>$4,860 / month</b></li><li><span>Tracking issues</span><b>3</b></li><li class=tot><span>Quick wins</span><b>9</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Account audits</b><p>Every platform you run, checked by hand.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Tracking audit</b><p>Every conversion tested.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Landing page review</b><p>Where clicks are lost.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Fix list</b><p>Ranked by value and effort.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Audit reports</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> A ranked fix list</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> A walkthrough call</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--3\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-308-team\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-308-t-team\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Your specialists are good, but there’s nobody senior to check their thinking.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">A senior consultant on call, without hiring one.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Many companies don’t need an agency; they need a senior person to check the work.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Reviews with your specialists, not instead of them</li><li>Clear, written recommendations</li><li>Training where there are gaps</li><li>No lock-in</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Your team grows, and you keep control.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">This month</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Accounts reviewed</span><b>4</b></li><li><span>Recommendations</span><b>12</b></li><li><span>Training sessions</span><b>2</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Monthly reviews</b><p>A senior review of every account.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Weekly calls</b><p>Answers to the questions that come up.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Test design</b><p>Experiments set up to give clear answers.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Training</b><p>Workshops on tracking, bidding and creative.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Monthly account reviews</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> A weekly call</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Training sessions</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--4\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-308-agency\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-308-t-agency\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>You pay an agency, but reports are vague and results are flat.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">An independent check on your agency.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Sometimes the fix is a better brief and closer oversight, not a new agency.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Agency work reviewed against best practice</li><li>Reports checked against your CRM</li><li>Targets agreed in writing</li><li>Monthly oversight</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You get the results you’re paying for, or the evidence to change.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Agency check</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Search terms reviewed</span><b>Last: 4 months ago</b></li><li><span>Tracking</span><b>Counts twice</b></li><li><span>Report</span><b>Clicks only</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Agency audit</b><p>What they do, what they don’t, and what it’s worth.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Reporting review</b><p>Are the numbers right?</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Brief and targets</b><p>Clear goals for your agency.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Oversight</b><p>Monthly checks on their work.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> An agency audit</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Clear targets</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Monthly oversight</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "performance-marketing-consulting",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
