   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Consulting in four stages",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-311\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-311\">Consulting in <span class=\"accent\">four stages</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Pick a stage to see what we do with your team.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2\" data-tabs style=\"--n:4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Consulting stages\"><button class=\"cmst2__tab cmst2__tab--attract\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bs-310-t-attract\" aria-controls=\"bs-310-attract\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmst2__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmst2__tt\"><b>Assess</b><span>Where are we now?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"cmst2__tab cmst2__tab--trust\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bs-310-t-trust\" aria-controls=\"bs-310-trust\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmst2__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmst2__tt\"><b>Plan</b><span>What should we do?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"cmst2__tab cmst2__tab--convert\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bs-310-t-convert\" aria-controls=\"bs-310-convert\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmst2__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmst2__tt\"><b>Build</b><span>How do we do it?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"cmst2__tab cmst2__tab--keep\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bs-310-t-keep\" aria-controls=\"bs-310-keep\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmst2__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmst2__tt\"><b>Review</b><span>Is it working?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t</button></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__panel cmst2__panel--attract\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bs-310-attract\" aria-labelledby=\"bs-310-t-attract\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<aside class=\"cmst2__brief\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__hero\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__step\">Stage 1 of 4</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__name\">Assess</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__lab\">What buyers are thinking</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__quote\">“Where are we now?”</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmst2__goals\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__g cmst2__g--do\"><dt>What content has to do</dt><dd>Find out what’s really happening</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__g cmst2__g--kpi\"><dt>How we measure it</dt><dd>An agreed picture of today</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__count\"><b>2</b> content types for this stage</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmst2__cards\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmsc2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__n\">01</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Account audits</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__d\">Every platform checked by hand.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmsc2__facts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Who reads it</dt><dd>Your marketing lead</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Reports, calls</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Shows what’s working and what isn’t</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"cmsc2__eg\"><p>Wasted spend sized in money</p></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"cmsc2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__n\">02</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Tracking audit</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__d\">Every conversion tested against your CRM.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmsc2__facts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Who reads it</dt><dd>Marketing and sales</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Test report</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Numbers you can trust</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"cmsc2__eg\"><p>One source of truth</p></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"cmst2__panel cmst2__panel--trust\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bs-310-trust\" aria-labelledby=\"bs-310-t-trust\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<aside class=\"cmst2__brief\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__hero\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__step\">Stage 2 of 4</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__name\">Plan</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__lab\">What buyers are thinking</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__quote\">“What should we do?”</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmst2__goals\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__g cmst2__g--do\"><dt>What content has to do</dt><dd>Agree goals, channels and budgets</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__g cmst2__g--kpi\"><dt>How we measure it</dt><dd>A plan everyone signs off</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__count\"><b>2</b> content types for this stage</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmst2__cards\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmsc2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__n\">01</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Channel plan</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__d\">Which platforms do which job.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmsc2__facts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Who reads it</dt><dd>Leadership</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Workshop, plan</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Focus</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"cmsc2__eg\"><p>Google captures, Meta creates</p></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"cmsc2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__n\">02</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Budget model</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__d\">Spend, targets and when to scale.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmsc2__facts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Who reads it</dt><dd>Finance and marketing</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Spreadsheet model</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Confident budgets</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"cmsc2__eg\"><p>Target cost per sale by channel</p></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"cmst2__panel cmst2__panel--convert\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bs-310-convert\" aria-labelledby=\"bs-310-t-convert\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<aside class=\"cmst2__brief\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__hero\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__step\">Stage 3 of 4</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__name\">Build</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__lab\">What buyers are thinking</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__quote\">“How do we do it?”</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmst2__goals\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__g cmst2__g--do\"><dt>What content has to do</dt><dd>Help your team put it in place</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__g cmst2__g--kpi\"><dt>How we measure it</dt><dd>Changes made and working</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__count\"><b>2</b> content types for this stage</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmst2__cards\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmsc2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__n\">01</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Hands-on help</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__d\">We work with your team on the hard parts.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmsc2__facts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Who reads it</dt><dd>Your specialists</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Working sessions</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Faster progress</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"cmsc2__eg\"><p>Tracking rebuilt together</p></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"cmsc2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__n\">02</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Training</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__d\">Workshops where there are gaps.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmsc2__facts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Who reads it</dt><dd>Your team</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Workshops</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>What it does</dt><dd>A stronger team</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"cmsc2__eg\"><p>Bidding and creative testing</p></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"cmst2__panel cmst2__panel--keep\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bs-310-keep\" aria-labelledby=\"bs-310-t-keep\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<aside class=\"cmst2__brief\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__hero\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__step\">Stage 4 of 4</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__name\">Review</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__lab\">What buyers are thinking</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__quote\">“Is it working?”</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmst2__goals\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__g cmst2__g--do\"><dt>What content has to do</dt><dd>Keep improving</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmst2__g cmst2__g--kpi\"><dt>How we measure it</dt><dd>Monthly progress against targets</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmst2__count\"><b>2</b> content types for this stage</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmst2__cards\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmsc2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__n\">01</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Monthly reviews</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__d\">A senior check of every account.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmsc2__facts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Who reads it</dt><dd>Your team</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Call and notes</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Fewer mistakes</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"cmsc2__eg\"><p>12 recommendations this month</p></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"cmsc2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__n\">02</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Quarterly planning</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmsc2__d\">Budgets and tests for the next quarter.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"cmsc2__facts\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Who reads it</dt><dd>Leadership</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Formats</dt><dd>Workshop</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Steady growth</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"cmsc2__eg\"><p>Next quarter’s budget split</p></blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "performance-marketing-consulting",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
